  /* `pattern-copy-id`, verbatim in everything but the class name: 20x20, ghost, the glyph swaps to
     a check for ~1.1s and swaps back. The tick is the confirmation — no toast, because copying is
     not an event worth a page-level announcement — and the button carries an `aria-label` naming
     what it copies rather than a native `title=`. */
