     sweep attaches a transcript; the difference here is that the person can read what they are
     sending before they send it, and that only pays if the closed state says what it holds. */
  .sb-hand-sum {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: var(--bo-t-12);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--bo-muted);
